   "textLength": 194,
   "text": "Cuba secures a 2028 Olympic berth in men's indoor volleyball with a 3-1 victory (25-21, 25-23, 23-25, 25-22) in the final of the 2026 NORCECA Men's Continental Olympic Qualifier in Moncton, N.B.",
