  {
   "index": 9,
   "tag": "p×2",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 290,
   "text": "Canada's men's volleyball team fell 3-1 to Cuba in the final of continental qualifications for the 2028 Los Angeles Olympics on Saturday in Moncton, N.B.\nSet scores were 25-21, 25-23, 23-25, 25-22, as Cuba earned the continental spot for its first trip to the Olympics since the 2016 Games.",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 2,
    "repeats": 2,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 1097,
    "height": 124,
    "widthFraction": 0.51,
    "leftFraction": 0.12,
    "pageFraction": 0.24,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 10,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 216,
   "text": "Canada had defeated Mexico 3-0 in Friday's semifinal.\nThe Canadians also finished runner-up to the Olympic-host United States earlier in the week in the NORCECA volleyball championship to earn a 2027 World Cup berth.",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 2,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 1249,
    "height": 100,
    "widthFraction": 0.51,
    "leftFraction": 0.12,
    "pageFraction": 0.28,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 11,
   "tag": "p×4",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 652,
   "text": "\"It's super disappointing,\" Canada’s libero Landon Currie said. \"I thought we came out really strong and all of a sudden, at the flip of a switch, Cuba came out swinging and we didn't really have an answer for them.\n\"They picked up their serve and scored a decent amount of aces on us. At the end of the day, I'm proud of this group and I love these guys to death. Our path to LA gets more difficult ",
